iji-125-ningxing:m001-0147","c-shiji-125-ningxing:m001-0166"]}],"rationale":"袁盎篇與佞幸篇均明示孝文時宦者趙同為參乘；季布篇曹丘生所事趙同，對讀漢書同一曹丘段趙談及李奇明解宦者趙談，與徐廣所記避諱異名相合。只接漢文帝朝此人，不與春秋趙同合。 原詞、引文與錨點分存，同書互見不作獨立史實票數；未核書影。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"identity_materialized":true,"references":[{"title":"《漢書》卷三十七·曹丘生事趙談·李奇注","commentator":"李奇","quote":"宦者趙談也","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0007/blob/683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454/KR2a0007_037.txt","source_kind":"received_ancient_commentary","witness_commit":"683113d4baf6febecaf2ccb7913df87c4d68d454","page_id":"KR2a0007_WYG_037-3b","witness_sha256":"59ecdbc05321c32c68c4cc4d4287b5c5f9b2f61f8bc5ae5a47df6c5bfd09b64c","verification_scope":"specified_digital_quote_only","image_verified":false},{"title":"《史記三家註》卷一百·趙同·集解","commentator":"徐廣","quote":"《漢書》作『趙談』，司馬遷以其父名談，故改之。","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記三家註/卷100&oldid=2514770","source_kind":"received_ancient_commentary","revision_id":2514770,"revision_timestamp":"2025-01-06T08:31:08Z","image_verified":false}]}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:p004","text":"楚人曹丘生，辯士，數招權顧金錢。事貴人趙同等，與竇長君善。季布聞之，寄書諫竇長君曰：「吾聞曹丘生非長者，勿與通。」及曹丘生歸，欲得書請季布。竇長君曰：「季將軍不説足下，足下無往。」固請書，遂行。使人先發書，季布果大怒，待曹丘。曹丘至，即揖季布曰：「楚人諺曰『得黃金百（斤），不如得季布一諾』，足下何以得此聲於梁楚閒哉？且仆楚人，足下亦楚人也。仆游揚足下之名於天下，顧不重邪？何足下距仆之深也！」季布乃大説，引入，留數月，爲上客，厚送之。季布名所以益聞者，曹丘揚之也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m004-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"曹丘生","kind":"person","person_id":"tnc_ag2_eej","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m004-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"趙同","kind":"person","person_id":"qyn_07y_0gt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m004-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"竇長君","kind":"person","person_id":"ra9_o4d_rli","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m004-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"季布","kind":"person","person_id":"udu_dyy_4wd","status":"